{"schemaVersion":1,"shard":254,"count":32,"items":[{"key":"[\"B1L02-2-09\",\"快乐\",\"快樂\",\"快乐\",\"Vs\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"啊！今天是你的生日。生日快樂！","pinyin":"Ā! Jīntiān shì nǐ de shēngrì. Shēngrì kuàilè!","english":"Ah! It is your birthday today. Happy birthday!","sourceCardId":"B1L02-2-09","sourceFront":"快樂","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"宜文，生日快樂！","pinyin":"Yíwén, shēngrì kuàilè!","english":"Happy birthday, Yiwen!","sourceCardId":"B1L02-2-01","sourceFront":"明天","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B1L04-1-06\",\"冷\",\"冷\",\"冷\",\"Vs\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"秋天的天氣最好，不冷也不熱。","pinyin":"Qiūtiān de tiānqì zuì hǎo, bù lěng yě bú rè.","english":"The weather is the best in autumn, not too cold and not too hot.","sourceCardId":"B1L04-3-01","sourceFront":"夏天","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":3},{"chinese":"這兩天天氣有點兒冷，我們週末去，好嗎？","pinyin":"Zhè liǎng tiān tiānqì yǒudiǎnr lěng, wǒmen zhōumò qù, hǎo ma?","english":"It is a bit cold those two days. How about we do it this weekend?","sourceCardId":"B1L06-2-01","sourceFront":"電影","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"最近天氣冷了，很多人感冒了。","pinyin":"Zuìjìn tiānqì lěng le, hěn duō rén gǎnmào le.","english":"The weather is getting cold recently, many people got colds.","sourceCardId":"B1L10-2-01","sourceFront":"咳嗽/咳","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"an 冫(ice) takes 令(command) from winter winds → 冷(cold)."},{"key":"[\"B1L04-2-06\",\"瓶\",\"瓶\",\"瓶\",\"M\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"你很渴嗎？我有一瓶飲料，你要不要喝？","pinyin":"Nǐ hěn kě ma? Wǒ yǒu yì píng yǐnliào, nǐ yào bú yào hē?","english":"Are you thirsty? I have a bottle of beverage, would you like to have some?","sourceCardId":"B1L04-2-06","sourceFront":"瓶","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"這個蛋糕跟這瓶果汁一共多少錢？","pinyin":"Zhè ge dàngāo gēn zhè píng guǒzhī yígòng duōshǎo qián?","english":"How much do this cake and this bottle of juice cost?","sourceCardId":"B1L05-2-01","sourceFront":"跟","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"a 并(merge) of 瓦(tile) clay holds water → a tall 瓶(bottle)."},{"key":"[\"B1L04-3-02\",\"春天\",\"春天\",\"春天\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"春天來了，天氣暖和了，森林裡的草也綠了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L07-2-06","sourceFront":"暖和","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"春天來了，天氣變暖和了，院子裡開了各種顏色的花，給人帶來一種新的希望。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L06-2-25","sourceFront":"開花","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"春天是花開的季節，在愛情故事中，往往也是適合戀愛的季節。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-1-04","sourceFront":"開","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"春(springtime) + 天(day) → the days of springtime are the season spring."},{"key":"[\"B1L08-1-18\",\"高\",\"高\",\"高\",\"Vs\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"老師說要送我們書，我們都很高興。","pinyin":"Lǎoshī shuō yào sòng wǒmen shū, wǒmen dōu hěn gāoxìng.","english":"The teacher said she/he is going to give us some books as gifts; we are all very happy.","sourceCardId":"B1L06-3-15","sourceFront":"高興","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":4}],"wordHook":"a 亠(lid) sits on a 口(mouth) that calls out over the 冋(desert) → the tower grows 高(tall)."},{"key":"[\"B1L11-3-10\",\"照相機\",\"照相機\",\"照相机\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"A:這個照相機是誰的？ B:是我爸爸的。","pinyin":"A: Zhège zhàoxiàngjī shì shéi de? B: Shì wǒ bàba de.","english":"A: Whose camera is this? B: It's my dad's.","sourceCardId":"B1L11-3-10","sourceFront":"照相機","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":1},{"chinese":"那個照相機貴得不得了，我買不起。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L04-2-13","sourceFront":"起","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我承認你的照相機是被我弄壞的，我一定負責把它修理好。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-2-13","sourceFront":"承認","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這支手機的照相功能很強，拍出來的效果比照相機還要好。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L13-1-28","sourceFront":"效果","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"照相機 means camera: 照(take photo) + 相(image) + 機(machine) → a machine that takes your image."},{"key":"[\"B1L14-2-15\",\"重\",\"重\",\"重\",\"Vs\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"帶這麼重的東西，走了兩個小時，我覺得很累。","pinyin":"Dài zhème zhòng de dōngxī, zǒu le liǎng ge xiǎoshí, wǒ juéde hěn lèi.","english":"Carrying such heavy things and walking for two hours, I feel very tired.","sourceCardId":"B1L14-2-15","sourceFront":"重","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"結婚以前，他覺得工作最重要，現在他覺得家人最重要。","pinyin":"Jiéhūn yǐqián, tā juéde gōngzuò zuì zhòngyào, xiànzài tā juéde jiārén zuì zhòngyào.","english":"Before getting married, he felt work was most important; now he feels family is most important.","sourceCardId":"B1L12-3-11","sourceFront":"重要","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":4},{"chinese":"元宵節燈會是華人新年的重要活動。","pinyin":"Yuánxiāojié dēnghuì shì Huárén xīnnián de zhòngyào huódòng.","english":"The Lantern Festival Lantern Carnival is an important event for Chinese New Year.","sourceCardId":"B1L15-2-09","sourceFront":"燈會","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"雖然工作很重要，不過身體健康更重要。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L06-1-03","sourceFront":"不過","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我的行李很重，除了大衣、外套，還裝了一些書。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L07-2-09","sourceFront":"外套","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我最近每天運動，體重減了兩公斤。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L10-1-24","sourceFront":"減","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"小孩子的手比較沒有力，沒辦法拿很重的東西。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L10-2-06","sourceFront":"力","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"陳可欣極重視考試的成績，可是她覺得參加社團也會有很多收穫。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L11-2-20","sourceFront":"重視","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這次的比賽很重要，大家一定要好好地表現。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L15-2-24","sourceFront":"表現","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"小王手裡提著那麼多東西，好像很重，我們過去幫他提一些吧！","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L02-1-01","sourceFront":"提","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"在臺灣，不少大學教室裡的桌、椅是連在一起的，搬起來有點重。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L02-2-03","sourceFront":"連","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"想要吸引顧客來購買價格高的商品，除了品質好，服務態度也很重要。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L03-1-34","sourceFront":"購買","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"地震時要保護自己的安全，最重要的是避免頭部受傷","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-1-01","sourceFront":"地震","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"孔先生很重視生活品質，也很喜歡做家事，所以總是把家裡整理得乾乾淨淨的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-1-23","sourceFront":"整理","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這個地區被颱風破壞得相當嚴重，不是樹木倒了，就是屋頂被吹走了，情況非常糟糕。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-1-24","sourceFront":"糟糕","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"因為有人喝酒後開車，造成了嚴重的交通意外，警察和救護車都趕來了","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-1-34","sourceFront":"意外","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"弟弟感冒了，可是他不但不吃藥，還一連吃了三碗冰，結果咳嗽咳得越來越嚴重了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-2-09","sourceFront":"結果","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這次強烈地震造成了嚴重的災情，不但許多房屋塌了，連橋也斷了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-2-10","sourceFront":"災情","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"公司很重視員工的身心健康，每年都安排一連五天的環島旅行，家人也可以參加。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L06-1-19","sourceFront":"身心","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我家在大馬路旁，從早到晚噪音不斷，嚴重影響了生活品質，所以決定搬家。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L06-2-09","sourceFront":"噪音","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"現在突然下起了大雨，我們的計畫被破壞了，恐怕今天所有的活動都必須重新安排。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L06-2-18","sourceFront":"重新","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這堂課的內容跟文化有關，所以老師把教學重心放在介紹各國的文化特色。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L09-1-12","sourceFront":"重心","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"如果你能掌握老師教學的重要內容，這次的測驗就一定能得到高分","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L09-1-15","sourceFront":"測驗","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"越來越多人使用網路上課，所以手機、電腦也就變成了重要的學習工具。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L09-1-23","sourceFront":"工具","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"當人們生活水準提高，開始重視生活品質時，休閒活動也就跟著多了起來。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L09-1-31","sourceFront":"水準","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"李小姐結婚以後的生活重心就是家庭，尤其是照顧剛出生的小孩。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L09-2-01","sourceFront":"尤其","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"上課時他把筆記寫在本子上，也把重點寫在不同顏色的便條(紙)上。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L09-2-13","sourceFront":"便條","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"電影明星一向很重視自己的穿著，合適的穿著才能讓他們更有品味、更有自信。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-1-05","sourceFront":"一向","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這次颱風引起的水災太嚴重，害大家一連五天沒有乾淨的水可以用。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-1-18","sourceFront":"害","sourceBookId":3,"sou