-21","sourceFront":"完整","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"Combining 簽(sign) and 證(prove): 簽證 means visa."},{"key":"[\"B3L07-2-03\",\"代表\",\"代表\",\"代表\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"華人用不一樣的動物代表每一年，一共有十二種動物。","pinyin":"Huárén yòng bù yíyàng de dòngwù dàibiǎo měi yì nián, yígòng yǒu shí'èr zhǒng dòngwù.","english":"Chinese use different animals to represent each year, and there are a total of twelve kinds of animals.","sourceCardId":"B1L15-1-01","sourceFront":"生肖","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4}],"wordHook":"代(replace) + 表(show) → you show up in place of someone: 代表(to represent)."},{"key":"[\"B3L09-2-13\",\"便條\",\"便條\",\"便条\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"上課時他把筆記寫在本子上，也把重點寫在不同顏色的便條(紙)上。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L09-2-13","sourceFront":"便條","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1}],"wordHook":"An 便(convenient) short memo scribbled on a paper 條(strip): 便條 means memo, note."},{"key":"[\"B3L10-2-03\",\"挫折\",\"挫折\",\"挫折\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"每個人一輩子都會遇到像沒考上大學、找不到工作那樣的挫折，但只要努力就有希望。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-2-03","sourceFront":"挫折","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"父母不能保護孩子一輩子，得讓他們自己經驗一些挫折，才能培養出堅強的性格。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-2-04","sourceFront":"堅強","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2},{"chinese":"當我遇到挫折時，他總是協助我克服困難，我們之間也建立了珍貴的友誼。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-2-15","sourceFront":"友誼","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他願意挑戰自己的工作能力，並積極地克服挫折，真是難得。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L04-1-04","sourceFront":"難得","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"喜劇中的男女主角，不論相處過程中碰到多少挫折，結局總是快樂又幸福的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L08-2-06","sourceFront":"喜劇","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"雖然受到了重大的挫折，可是他並沒有放棄自己的夢想。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-1-23","sourceFront":"並","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"Combining 挫(check) and 折(break): 挫折 means frustration."},{"key":"[\"B3L11-2-26\",\"花心\",\"花心\",\"花心\",\"Vs\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"小章已經結婚了，還常常跟其他女生約會，真是太花心了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-2-26","sourceFront":"花心","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"A:要是你發現男朋友對你越來越冷淡，還常跟女網友約會， 你會原諒他嗎？ B:這麼花心的男人，絕對不值得原諒。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L12-1-23","sourceFront":"原諒","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"談戀愛時不能太花心，(也)就是說不能見一個就愛一個。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L04-1-46","sourceFront":"就是說","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"Combining 花(flower) and 心(heart): 花心 means womanizing."},{"key":"[\"B3L15-1-08\",\"外交\",\"外交\",\"外交\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"國家跟國家之間的外交關係很重要，這方面的工作是總統負責的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-1-08","sourceFront":"外交","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"上次我出國旅行時，護照被偷了，幸好導遊通知了當地的外交人員，很快就辦好了新護照。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-1-33","sourceFront":"導遊","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"那名記者為了訪問總統外交、貿易等方面的問題，閱讀了許多相關的資料。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-1-10","sourceFront":"訪問","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"Combining 外(out) and 交(connect): 外交 means diplomacy."},{"key":"[\"B4L05-1-26\",\"浪費\",\"浪費\",\"浪费\",\"Vs\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"這家超商食品賣不完就丟掉的作法，不但白白浪費食物，回收處理的成本也增加了，長期下來十分浪費。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-1-26","sourceFront":"浪費","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"他用很珍貴的茶具來泡品質很普通的茶葉，真浪費。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-2-07","sourceFront":"普通","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L06-2-33\",\"臺上一分鐘，臺下十年功\",\"臺上一分鐘，臺下十年功\",\"台上一分钟，台下十年功\",\"Ph\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L11-1-15\",\"歲數\",\"歲數\",\"岁数\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"那位新郎的歲數比新娘大十五歲，可是兩人看起來一樣年輕。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-1-15","sourceFront":"歲數","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L15-1-06\",\"展示\",\"展示\",\"展示\",\"V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"設計師利用上電視的機會，展示他今年設計的服裝。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-1-06","sourceFront":"展示","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"word\",\"優\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"A 亻(person) who carries 憂(grief) yet keeps going is the 優(superior) one."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"太\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"a 大(big) figure grabs one extra dot below → now it is 太(too)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"怪\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"a 忄(heart) kneels at a 圣(holy) shrine → 怪(unusual)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"想像\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"To 想(think) a 像(picture): 想像 means imagination."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"訪\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Directing polite 言(speech) toward someone in that 方(direction) as you travel to meet is a formal 訪(visit)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"達成\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Combining 達(reach) and 成(become): 達成 means reach."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"餐桌\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"A table for dining 餐(eat) gathered around the 桌(table): 餐桌 means dining table."}]}
